// Oren native runtime (native backend) — capsule-enabled variant
//
// This file is intentionally small.
//
// The native backend expands `// @include "..."` directives at compile time and
// injects the resulting concatenated source as the runtime.
//
// Edit the runtime in `lib/runtime_native/*.oren`.
//
// NOTE: include order is semantically significant (kept identical to the former
// monolithic `lib/runtime_native.oren`).
//
// Capsule policy:
// - Non-capsule builds should prefer `lib/runtime_native.oren` (no capsule hooks).
// - Capsule builds should use this entry file so the `native_capsule_*` ABI surface exists.

